{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmg9VG8q8wZT4Pn1mDXv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll ask you, and maybe the bank too. I didn't pick anything. I'm not sure enough to move pension money because of this page. The only things on it I recognised were \"גמל אג\"ח ממשלות\" and \"כספי (שקלי)\". Government bonds I know are safe, and those two lines show 0% next to \"מניות\". But I don't know if that's the right kind of track for money that has to last years.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **First screen:** dark, with the title \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". The button \"תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים 182\" was already chosen, so I was in the right place. A yellow box said \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\". It also said management fees run from 0.15% to 2%. Then a row of buttons, one of them \"עוקב מדד s&p 500\" in English letters. That already told me this is mostly about shares.\n- **Second screen on:** one long table, lines and lines of percentages, with little coloured rings next to them. At first I couldn't see whose tracks these were. The company names (מור, הפניקס, אלטשולר שחם) only show up as grey bars between rows when you scroll past them.\n- **What I wrote down:**\n  - \"גמל אג\"ח ממשלות\": fee 0.52%, \"3 שנים 4.9%\", \"5 שנים 2.69%\"\n  - \"גמל כספי (שקלי)\": about 4.4% over 3 years\n  - The Phoenix (הפניקס) has \"גמל בניהול אישי\" with a fee of only 0.15%\n  - The share tracks show big numbers like 22% and 28%. That's exactly the kind of thing that fell on me once, so I left them alone.\n\n**What I didn't understand:**\n- \"מט\"ח\" and \"חשיפה\"\n- How a track can be \"101%\" or \"103%\" in shares. Over a hundred percent of what?\n- \"מחקה\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"s&p500\"\n- \"לפני דמי ניהול\": does that mean the fee still comes off the number?\n- \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\": is 4.9% each year, or for all three years together? It sounds like each year, but I'm not sure I read it right.\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", \"לא דווח\", \"עוד לא דווח\", and the little orange warning sign next to some of them\n- Two fees for every track, \"מהחיסכון\" and \"מההפקדות\". Which one is the bank's fee?\n- The rings in two colours, green and yellow, which I can't tell apart well\n- The question marks in the column headers. I didn't press them.\n\n**Hard to read:** the grey writing on black, especially the small headers like \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח, סוף ספטמבר 2026\".\n\n**Where I got tired:** By the third screen my eyes hurt and I was anxious from all the numbers. After the sixth screen I stopped. There were many more screens below that I never reached."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3789,"cache_read_input_tokens":11741,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3789},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9253ebd3-c1cf-4702-bc1d-a9c0ba0feda5","uuid":"d02fc3f9-a991-41be-9f1a-77e5a633251c","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:29:35.632Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmg9V3zApdnePNvpRUAM"}
